<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\エリカの部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s clothes are like this, and <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, I suppose this will do."
{CHGVOL "BGM" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
"Hm? From <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm bringing someone like this over soon, so be nice to her!"</STYLE><PG>
"There's a link to a video."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, go ahead. New phone video test, start!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hiii! I'm the genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included, Erina Goto!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why the twin tails...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Because I figured this way you could check the fine movements of the hair and stuff!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, do whatever you want, but..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Look, look, see how smooth it is, right down to the soft movement of my hair!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Can't tell till we play it back... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, okay if I send this video to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I want to let her know someone like this is coming soon."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oho? A video of this genius girl Erina Goto doesn't come cheap, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Well, just this once, it's specially free of charge!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"So you're charging next time...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\エリカの部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"All right!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ノートPC.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Search for 'Motoki High School uniform,' and..."<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\duble_clicks.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Well, well, the Motoki Pretty Girl Appreciation Society... 
{PAUSE ""}
They're selling uniforms that graduates wore, online. 
{PAUSE ""}
2,000 yen apiece..."<PG>
"All right, buy!"
{PLAYSND "SE\duble_clicks.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I've got to make them feel happy, even just a little..."<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
